    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of going on a road trip adventure on a hot Saturday night? Well, this is your chance. Turn off the lights, crank up your headphones, and dive into a journey full of <strong>mystery and terror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts in the most ordinary way. A car travels down an old road, heading toward its destination: the City of Lights. Nothing exciting, right? That\u2019s how it seems\u2014until the driver decides to pick up a hitchhiker...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But... what about that truck that\u2019s suddenly appeared behind us and doesn\u2019t seem to want to back off? And what\u2019s going on with the radio\u2014why is it broadcasting such strange messages?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hot summer night where anything can happen, and <strong>your choices\u2014through the conversation</strong> between the two characters\u2014will determine your final fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you be able to do in Midnight Road?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the dialogues of a mysterious and unsettling visual novel, with specific moments where you can choose between three options to, with a bit of luck, change the course of the story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of going on a road trip adventure on a hot Saturday night? Well, this is your chance. Turn off the lights, crank up your headphones, and dive into a journey full of <strong>mystery and terror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts in the most ordinary way. A car travels down an old road, heading toward its destination: the City of Lights. Nothing exciting, right? That\u2019s how it seems\u2014until the driver decides to pick up a hitchhiker...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But... what about that truck that\u2019s suddenly appeared behind us and doesn\u2019t seem to want to back off? And what\u2019s going on with the radio\u2014why is it broadcasting such strange messages?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hot summer night where anything can happen, and <strong>your choices\u2014through the conversation</strong> between the two characters\u2014will determine your final fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you be able to do in Midnight Road?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the dialogues of a mysterious and unsettling visual novel, with specific moments where you can choose between three options to, with a bit of luck, change the course of the story.</p>",
